      "preview": "בַּז: despojamento, roubo; despojo, botim, saque.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בַּז</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] <strong>despojamento, roubo; despojo, botim</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span> estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:3\" href=\"/Numbers.14.3\">Nm 14.3</a> +; assim também <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.7\">Ez 25.7</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">בג</span> sem sentido); <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּ֑ז</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.14\">Jr 2.14</a> +; mas <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבָּ֔ז</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:32\" href=\"/Numbers.31.32\">Nm 31.32</a> v. d. H.; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּזָּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.19\">Ez 29.19</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>despojamento, roubo</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְב׳</span> isto é, ser saqueado, despojado <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.21\">Ez 7.21</a> (do templo ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלָל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:46\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.46\">Ez 23.46</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>despojo, botim, saque</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.6\">Is 10.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">Is 33.23</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.19\">Ez 29.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.12\">Ez 38.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.13\">Ez 38.13</a> (todos acusativos cognatos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלָל</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:32\" href=\"/Numbers.31.32\">Nm 31.32</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.13\">Jr 15.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.3\">Jr 17.3</a>; na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיָה לָבַז</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.32\">Jr 49.32</a> (de camelos) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.4\">Ez 36.4</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.5\">Ez 36.5</a>; também de seres humanos <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:3\" href=\"/Numbers.14.3\">Nm 14.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:31\" href=\"/Numbers.14.31\">Nm 14.31</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:39\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.39\">Dt 1.39</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.14\">Jr 2.14</a> (todos <span dir=\"rtl\">היה לב׳</span>) + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.14\">2Rs 21.14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשִׁסָּה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">Is 42.22</a> (‖ <em>idem</em>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.14\">Jr 2.14</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.16\">Jr 30.16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשִׁסָּה</span>); também <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.7\">Ez 25.7</a> Qr, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.5\">Ez 26.5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">היה לב׳</span>; ambos em personificação); figuradamente, de Israel como ovelhas <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.8\">Ez 34.8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.22\">Ez 34.22</a> (ambos <span dir=\"rtl\">היה לב׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.28\">Ez 34.28</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">היה בז</span> (sem <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>). Sobre <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.1\">Is 8.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.3\">Is 8.3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר שָׁלָל חָשׁ בַּז</span> ver <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, מהר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_מהר\">מהר</a>.",
